Package: drobocli
Source: drobo-rutils
Version: 0.1.0-1
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Peter Silva <Peter.A.Silva@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: 980
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libgcc-s1 (>= 4.2)
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/peter/drobo-rutils
Description: Command-line management tool for Drobo storage units (Rust)
 drobocli is a modern Rust command-line tool for Data Robotics Drobo
 storage arrays. It allows querying unit status, drive slot LEDs, LUNs,
 updating options, blinking lights, and dumping diagnostics.
